ass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-quotient.md\">../batch19/58-df-quotient.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,C^-,d^-,C^+,d^+,C^\\infty,d^\\infty,H^-,H^+,H^\\infty\\in V\">\\(Y,C^-,d^-,C^+,d^+,C^\\infty,d^\\infty,H^-,H^+,H^\\infty\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplexOver}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplexOver}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyModule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyModule}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\)</span> (manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientableManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientableManifold}_S\\)</span> (orientable-manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fb3df47c91e4a261\" href=\"?note=fb3df47c91e4a261\" title=\"58-df-orientable.md\">58-df-orientable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (structured module predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\)</span> (quotient-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-quotient.md\">../batch19/58-df-quotient.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HFModule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HFModule}_S\\)</span> (Heegaard Floer module-package relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}three\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{OrientableManifold}_S(Y,3)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}three\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{OrientableManifold}_S(Y,3)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\n(C,d,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,C,C)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nd(x+_Cy)=d(x)+_Cd(y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\nd(r\\odot_Cx)=r\\odot_Cd(x)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;(d(d(x))=0_C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\n(C,d,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,C,C)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nd(x+_Cy)=d(x)+_Cd(y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\nd(r\\odot_Cx)=r\\odot_Cd(x)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;(d(d(x))=0_C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}over}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexOver}_S(C,d,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\n(C,d,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}over}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexOver}_S(C,d,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\n(C,d,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homology\\text{-}module}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomologyModule}_S(H,C,d,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C,Z,B,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\n(C,d,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land Z=\\{x\\in C\\mid d(x)=0_C\\}\n\\land B=d[C]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in Z\\times Z\\mid\n\\exists b\\in B\\;(x=y+_Cb)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(H,Z,E)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homology\\text{-}module}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomologyModule}_S(H,C,d,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C,Z,B,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexDatum}_S\n(C,d,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land Z=\\{x\\in C\\mid d(x)=0_C\\}\n\\land B=d[C]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in Z\\times Z\\mid\n\\exists b\\in B\\;(x=y+_Cb)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(H,Z,E)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}floer}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HFModule}_S(Y,C^-,d^-,C^+,d^+,C^\\infty,d^\\infty,H^-,H^+,H^\\infty)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigwedge_{\\circ\\in\\{-,+,\\infty\\}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexOver}_S(C^\\circ,d^\\circ,\\mathbb Z[U])\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyModule}_S\n(H^\\circ,C^\\circ,d^\\circ,\\mathbb Z[U])\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}floer}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HFModule}_S(Y,C^-,d^-,C^+,d^+,C^\\infty,d^\\infty,H^-,H^+,H^\\infty)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigwedge_{\\circ\\in\\{-,+,\\infty\\}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexOver}_S(C^\\circ,d^\\circ,\\mathbb Z[U])\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyModule}_S\n(H^\\circ,C^\\circ,d^\\circ,\\mathbb Z[U])\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom now formalizes only the homology layer relative to three supplied <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z[U]\">\\(\\mathbb Z[U]\\)</span>-chain complexes. Constructing those complexes from an admissible pointed Heegaard diagram and proving diagram-independence are separate upstream obligations; they are no longer hidden as undeclared “canonical” objects.</li>\n<li>The differential is checked against one explicit module structure, its square is pointwise zero, and homology is a registered quotient of the explicit cycle set by the explicit boundary set. No free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker\">\\(\\ker\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{im}\">\\(\\operatorname{im}\\)</span> operations remain.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{HF}(Y)\">\\(\\widehat{HF}(Y)\\)</span> is an invariant of the closed oriented three-manifold <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> once that construction and invariance theorem are supplied.</li>\n<li>Knot Floer homology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{HFK}(Y,K)\">\\(\\widehat{HFK}(Y,K)\\)</span> is a downstream invariant obtained from a knot-filtered Heegaard Floer complex.</li>\n<li>Four-manifold invariants are constructed from cobordism maps on Heegaard Floer groups.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","e